# The golden report files are compared byte for byte by tests/report_rendering.rs, and the renderer
# emits `\n` on every platform. Without this, a checkout on Windows — where git ships with
# `core.autocrlf=true`, as GitHub's runners do — rewrites them to CRLF and every line differs.
*.report.md text eol=lf

# The inputs those goldens are generated from, pinned for the same reason: the conversion should not
# depend on the platform the repository was checked out on.
tests/fixtures/*.csv text eol=lf

# The app icon: embedded into the Windows executables by build.rs and into the GUI binary by
# `include_bytes!`. Marked binary so that no checkout can rewrite a byte of it.
assets/* binary
